# Vulnerabilities the image scan is told to accept (Phase 43).
#
# One CVE id per line, with the comment above it saying why it does not apply
# here and when to look at it again. An entry with no reason, or past its
# review date, is a bug: the point of the scan is that nothing is waved
# through without somebody having decided it.
#
# Format:
#   # <reason it does not apply>. Review by YYYY-MM-DD.
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNN
